{"title":"Beestar","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"1.Beestar_progressive_exercise_is_the_premier_after-school_enrichment_platform_for_K-12.\">1.<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.beestar.org/?&amp;mid=700&amp;div=1\">Beestar progressive exercise</a> is the premier after-school enrichment platform for K-12.</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beestar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: 1.Beestar progressive exercise is the premier after-school enrichment platform for K-12.\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>Since 2003，it has been providing innovative weekly online free math, reading, science, social studies, vocabulary, computer science exercises and helps thousands of students achieve excellent grades (Registration Open).  Parents can monitor performance online and know exactly what their students need. \n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://w2.beestar.org/user?cmd=hof\">Beestar Laureates</a><br /><br />\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.beestar.org/exercise/samples.jsp?&amp;mid=700&amp;div=1\">Samples Grade 1-8</a> <br />\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://hs.beestar.org/exercise/samples.jsp?&amp;mid=700&amp;div=1\">Samples Grade 9-12</a> <br />\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.beestar.org/worksheets/?&amp;mid=700&amp;div=1\">Download PDF for Basic Math Skills, Grade 1-8</a><br />\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.beestar.org/general/users_say.jsp\">What Others Say</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h4><span id=\"2._Beestar_math_competition_for_2nd_to_8th_grade_students_will_be_held_on_Mon.2C_Oct_19_.7E_Thursday.2C_Oct_22.2C_2026.\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2._Beestar_math_competition_for_2nd_to_8th_grade_students_will_be_held_on_Mon,_Oct_19_~_Thursday,_Oct_22,_2026.\">2. <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beestar_math_competition\" title=\"Beestar math competition\">Beestar math competition</a> for 2nd to 8th grade students will be held on Mon, Oct 19 ~ Thursday, Oct 22, 2026.</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beestar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: 2. Beestar math competition for 2nd to 8th grade students will be held on Mon, Oct 19 ~ Thursday, Oct 22, 2026.\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>Registration Open  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://w2.beestar.org/competition/?mid=700&amp;div=1\">here</a><br />\n<br />\n<b>8th Competition:</b> Dash Round\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g08_math/pdf/cp_math_g08_fall_yi20_dash.pdf\">Test </a><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g08_math/pdf/cp_math_g08_fall_yi20_dash_answer.pdf\">| Answers</a>; \nSpark Round <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g08_math/pdf/cp_math_g08_fall_yi20_spark.pdf\">Test </a><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g08_math/pdf/cp_math_g08_fall_yi20_spark_answer.pdf\">| Answers</a>\n</p><p><b>7th Competition:</b> Dash Round\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g07_math/pdf/cp_math_g07_fall_yi20_dash.pdf\">Test </a><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g07_math/pdf/cp_math_g07_fall_yi20_dash_answer.pdf\">| Answers</a>; \nSpark Round <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://i