/cp_sample/cp_fall_g04_math/pdf/cp_math_g04_fall_yi20_dash_answer.pdf\">| Answers</a>; \nSpark Round <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g04_math/pdf/cp_math_g04_fall_yi20_spark.pdf\">Test </a><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g04_math/pdf/cp_math_g04_fall_yi20_spark_answer.pdf\">| Answers</a>\n</p><p><b>3rd Competition:</b> Dash Round\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g03_math/pdf/cp_math_g03_fall_yi20_dash.pdf\">Test </a><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g03_math/pdf/cp_math_g03_fall_yi20_dash_answer.pdf\">| Answers</a>;\nSpark Round <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g03_math/pdf/cp_math_g03_fall_yi20_spark.pdf\">Test </a><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g03_math/pdf/cp_math_g03_fall_yi20_spark_answer.pdf\">| Answers</a>\n</p><p><b>2nd Competition:</b> Dash Round\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g02_math/pdf/cp_math_g02_fall_yi20_dash.pdf\">Test </a><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g02_math/pdf/cp_math_g02_fall_yi20_dash_answer.pdf\">| Answers</a>;\nSpark Round <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g02_math/pdf/cp_math_g02_fall_yi20_spark.pdf\">Test </a><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imo1.beestar.org/bs/images/cp_sample/cp_fall_g02_math/pdf/cp_math_g02_fall_yi20_spark_answer.pdf\">| Answers</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://w2.beestar.org/competition/?mid=700&amp;div=1\">Download Moc